1
00:40:50,115 --> 00:40:52,033
What business do you have with us?

2
00:40:53,034 --> 00:40:55,579
We have no conflict with you.

3
00:40:55,871 --> 00:40:57,872
We are only here...

4
00:40:57,873 --> 00:40:59,541
To speak to the French.

5
00:42:40,517 --> 00:42:42,060
Why are you here?

6
00:43:01,079 --> 00:43:04,082
Why do you hate them?

7
00:43:06,293 --> 00:43:08,502
When I was a child

8
00:43:08,503 --> 00:43:13,632
I was taken captive by the French

9
00:43:13,633 --> 00:43:18,345
I watched them boil my father.

10
00:43:18,346 --> 00:43:22,142
And eat him.

11
00:43:29,149 --> 00:43:32,652
From the royal Governor of Virginia:

12
00:43:32,694 --> 00:43:37,906
Sir, the lands upon the Ohio River are notoriously known

13
00:43:37,907 --> 00:43:41,827
to be the property of the Crown of Great Britain

14
00:43:41,828 --> 00:43:45,205
that it is a matter of equal concern and surprise to hear that a body of

15
00:43:45,206 --> 00:43:51,045
French forces are erecting fortresses within His Majesty's dominions.

16
00:43:51,046 --> 00:43:52,464
His dominion?

17
00:43:54,674 --> 00:43:56,217
Continue.

18
00:43:57,260 --> 00:44:01,597
In the name of the King, my master, I have sent the bearer hereof,

19
00:44:01,598 --> 00:44:08,063
Major George Washington, one of the Adjutants-General of this British Dominion.

20
00:59:04,041 --> 00:59:06,252
We should have killed everyone of you.

21
00:59:12,258 --> 00:59:14,343
Thou art not yet dead, my father.

